      "source": "urn:doxa:source-version:c12375f4bcfaa070cb7326b6b284014ace360628d6cbef690dbb84eada9dc340",
      "exact": "The exclusion zone would cover a block beyond the emergency route and limit public assembly. The council recommends assigning stewards to intersections and publishing response times.\n",
